title: "brehm_cpp: exact construction and certification of Brehm's piecewise-congruent extensions"
abstract: >-
  Exact construction of Brehm's piecewise-congruent extension of a planar distance-reducing map,
  with independent certificate checkers and a pointwise evaluator of Brehm's map.
